{"id":"u-31352ac4-81d9-4064-8f7a-0a9e7fbc139f","src":"community","title":"2 Day True Dumbbell Only Beginners","author":"George Tranter","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/qiuxZQ-2-day-true-dumbbell-only-beginners","desc":"This program is designed to help beginners build habits with basic movements that only require dumbbells.\n\nStart with a low weight to get used to the movements, and start at the low end of the rep range e.g. if the range is 3 sets of 8-12 reps, start with 3 sets of 8 reps.\n\nAim to increase reps each week. This is a goal, don't worry if you can't quite do it one week, but really push yourself! \n\nOnce you've reached the top end of a rep range (e.g. you can do 12 reps in 3 sets of a 3 set 8-12 rep exercise) then increase the weight slightly and start again at (in the prior example) 3 sets of 8 reps.\n\nAim for 30 seconds rest between sets, and a minute rest between different exercises.","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Women's"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":60,"joins":17,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-28T20:46:45.080Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest, Back, Shoulders, Arms","Core and Lower Body"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Floor Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Standing Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bent Over Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Tricep Kickback","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Shrug (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lunge (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"x":2}],"note":"8-10 on left side, and 8-10 on right side"},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"x":2}],"note":"If you don't have a box to stand on, that's fine just do it standing regul